# Microsoft DirectStorage runtime binaries and installer state are EULA-bound and
# machine-local. They are fetched by the editor installer (or
# tools/fetch_directstorage.ps1) and must not be committed: redistributing the
# DLLs is not covered by the package license, and this file travels with the
# addon so a downstream project cannot publish them by accident either.
#
# Ignoring them does not break exports: the files still exist on disk, and the
# .gdextension [dependencies] entries resolve against the filesystem at export
# time. A fresh clone simply has to install a runtime again, which re-shows the
# Microsoft license to whoever runs it.
bin/dstorage.dll
bin/dstoragecore.dll
bin/.versions/
bin/.runtime.json
bin/.pending.json
